# This repository holds release material only: the readme, the install guide,
# checksums, screenshots and patch files. Everything else is ignored, so that
# scripts, tools, source text and disc images can never be committed by mistake.

# Ignore everything...
*

# ...except these.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!INSTALL.md
!SHA1SUMS.txt
!LICENSE
!*.xdelta
!*.cue
!screenshots/
!screenshots/*.png
